---
description: Require reusable app modals instead of native browser dialogs
globs: frontend/src/**/*.{js,jsx,ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# No Native Browser Dialogs

- Never use `alert()`, `confirm()`, `prompt()`, or their `window.*` forms.
- Use an existing reusable modal component from `frontend/src/components`.
- Use `ConfirmationModal` for confirmations, including destructive actions.
- Extend an existing modal component when necessary instead of adding an ad hoc
  page-specific dialog.
- Modals must provide accessible dialog semantics and support canceling with
  Escape unless an action is actively processing.
